sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebhookEventService
    participant EventStorageService
    participant EventDeliveryService
    participant jbmRequestTemplate

    User->>WebhookEventService: sendBusinessEvent(config, task)
    WebhookEventService->>EventStorageService: enqueueEvent(serviceName, event)
    WebhookEventService->>EventDeliveryService: deliverNow(serviceName)
    alt 服务在线
        EventDeliveryService->>jbmRequestTemplate: request(url, method, body)
        jbmRequestTemplate-->>EventDeliveryService: Response
        EventDeliveryService->>EventStorageService: ackEvents(count)
    else 服务离线
        EventDeliveryService-->>WebhookEventService: 不发送，等待上线
    end
    Service上线->>EventDeliveryService: InstanceRegisteredEvent
    EventDeliveryService->>jbmRequestTemplate: 补发积压事件
